#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:2
msgid "Email Templates"
msgstr "Correo electrónico Templates"

#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| sends out email to its users periodically to alert for various"
" conditions such as an Instance provisioning success, warnings about "
"upcoming Instance expiration, requests for password reset links, and "
"more. |morpheus| includes system-default email templates for all of these"
" emailed conditions but allows users to create their own email templates "
"to override the default template."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| sends out correo electrónico a su usuarios periodically a "
"alert para various conditions como un Instancia aprovisionamiento "
"success, warnings acerca de upcoming Instancia expiration, requests para "
"contraseña reset links, y más. |morpheus| incluye system-predeterminado "
"correo electrónico templates para todos de estos emailed conditions pero "
"permite usuarios a crear su own correo electrónico templates a override "
"el predeterminado template."

#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:6
msgid ""
"On accessing the Email Templates tab, users will see a list of all email "
"templates that currently exist. We can also see the owner which created "
"the template as well as the associated Account (Tenant). System-default "
"templates are shown as being owned by \"System\" and show no associated "
"Account (Tenant). When a |mastertenant| user creates a template, the "
"option is given to tie the template to an Account or to make a global "
"template. The Accounts column will show \"Global\" for global templates. "
"Templates will apply in order of specificity: Tenant-specific templates "
"apply first, then custom global templates, and finally system templates "
"if no others exist for that email type."
msgstr ""
"En accessing el Correo electrónico Templates pestaña, usuarios va a see a"
" lista de todos correo electrónico templates ese currently existir. We "
"puede también consulte la propietario que creado el template así como el "
"associated Cuenta (Inquilino). System-predeterminado templates son shown "
"as being owned por \"System\" y show no associated Cuenta (Inquilino). "
"Cuando a |mastertenant| usuario crea a template, el opción es given a tie"
" el template a un Cuenta o a make a global template. El Cuentas column va"
" a show \"Global\" para global templates. Templates va a aplicar en order"
" de specificity: Inquilino-específico templates aplicar first, then "
"personalizado global templates, y finally system templates si no others "
"existir para ese correo electrónico tipo."

#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:8
#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:16
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:8
msgid ""
"Email templates apply in order of specificity. Tenant-specific templates "
"apply over custom global templates which apply over system-default "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"Correo electrónico templates aplicar en order de specificity. Inquilino-"
"específico templates aplicar over personalizado global templates que "
"aplicar over system-predeterminado templates."

#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:10
#, fuzzy
msgid ".. image:: /images/administration/settings/emailTemplateList.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/administration/settings/emailTemplateList.png"

#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:12
msgid "**Creating Templates**"
msgstr "**Creando Templates**"

#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:14
msgid ""
"Before creating the first template, it's important to realize email from "
"custom templates will still come wrapped in the standard |morpheus| email"
" headers and footers. It will also have included styling. This styling "
"comes directly from your Tenant whitelabel configuration and will include"
" |morpheus| standard styling or your custom whitelabel styling depending "
"on appliance configuration. The template itself should only include email"
" body content which will be inserted within the styling wrapper."
msgstr ""
"Antes de creando el first template, ello's important a realize correo "
"electrónico desde personalizado templates va a still come wrapped en el "
"standard |morpheus| correo electrónico headers y footers. It va a también"
" tienen included styling. Este styling comes directly desde su Inquilino "
"marca blanca configuración y va a include |morpheus| standard styling o "
"su personalizado marca blanca styling dependiendo de appliance "
"configuración. El template itself debería solo include correo electrónico"
" body content que será inserted dentro de el styling wrapper."

#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:16
msgid ""
"It is possible to break the functionality of certain types of generated "
"email by creating a custom template. For example, in a password reset "
"email, you must ensure the password reset button is still included with "
"the template. Other functionality-breaking scenarios may also be "
"possible. Review the system-default template of any email type to copy "
"syntax examples for such vital components."
msgstr ""
"Es possible a break el functionality de cierto tipos de generated correo "
"electrónico por creando a personalizado template. Por ejemplo, en a "
"contraseña reset correo electrónico, usted debe asegurar el contraseña "
"reset botón es still included con el template. Otro functionality-"
"breaking scenarios puede también be possible. Review el system-"
"predeterminado template de cualquier correo electrónico tipo a copy "
"syntax ejemplos para such vital components."

#: ../../administration/settings/emailTemplates.rst:18
msgid ""
"Some template types will have variables accessible, such as the logged in"
" user's name (to address the email) or an Instance name. To see the "
"available variables, click on the info button for the system-default "
"template of the type you wish to create. You'll see the variables "
"mentioned in a comment at the bottom of the template such as in this "
"example Confirm Password Update Template:"
msgstr ""
"Algunos template tipos va a tienen variables accessible, como el logged "
"en usuario's nombre (a address el correo electrónico) o un Instancia "
"nombre. Un consulte la disponible variables, haga clic en el info botón "
"para el system-predeterminado template de el tipo usted wish a crear. "
"You'll consulte la variables mentioned en a comment en el bottom de el "
"template como en este ejemplo Confirm Contraseña Update Template:"

